   "[mover] required ['EventTime', 'EventDetail', 'EventDetail/TypeId'] are left out when their input fields are empty, which makes the event invalid. Fine if those fields are always filled; otherwise give the mapping a default.",
   "[leaver] required ['EventTime', 'EventDetail', 'EventDetail/TypeId'] are left out when their input fields are empty, which makes the event invalid. Fine if those fields are always filled; otherwise give the mapping a default."
  ],
  "events": [
